    "Return BLOCKED on any subject or authority mismatch.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if any identity, exact-byte selection, persistence, replay, orphan, migration, recovery, refusal, evidence-preservation, negative, schema, or cross-document rule is incomplete, ambiguous, contradictory, cyclic, or broader than selected candidate 1.3.",
    "Do not waive or repair findings, create records, resume implementation, or begin HCM-2.3."
